  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan finishes refining Human Skin Gu, he retrieves old removal Gu from his aperture. It turns into a cooling breeze that flows over his body and permeates skin, tendons, and bones, washing away the modifications from ancient bronze skin, essence iron bones, and golden steel tendons.",
        "chapters": [
          432
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_human_skin_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan uses that clearing step so he can peel his own skin and grow a new layer with Human Skin Gu, taking Chang Shan Yin’s appearance.",
        "chapters": [
          432
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "disguise-preparation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chang_shan_yin"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later notes he has already used old removal Gu in secret to remove ancient bronze skin, essence iron bones, golden steel tendons, and even his beast phantoms. Southern border strength path phantoms would be restricted in northern plains and could expose his identity if summoned.",
        "chapters": [
          442
        ],
